OL,3,GNEWSA'My son was failed' - Noah Donohoe
OL,4,Ainquest finds tunnel errors possibly
OL,5,Acontributed to death
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe jury in the Noah Donohoe inquest
OL,8,Fhas found it was possible, but not
OL,9,Fprobable, that failings by the
OL,10,FDepartment of Infrastructure (DfI) over
OL,11,Fthe tunnel in which he was found dead
OL,12,Fcontributed to his death.
OL,14,FThe jury found that the DfI had failed
OL,15,Fto identify a hazard at the site, which
OL,16,Fit maintains, and that there was no
OL,17,Fwarning sign.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
