OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'My son was failed' - Noah Donohoe
OL,4,Ainquest finds tunnel errors possibly
OL,5,Acontributed to death
OL,6,
OL,7,FThey also found numerous failings in
OL,8,Fthe Police Service of Northern
OL,9,FIreland's (PSNI's) investigation but
OL,10,Fthat these did not contribute to the
OL,11,F14-year-old's death.
OL,13,FNoah's mother, Fiona Donohoe, said he
OL,14,Fhad been failed by both the department
OL,15,Fand police while the family's solicitor
OL,16,Fsaid she had suffered "indignity after
OL,17,Findignity".
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
